!!omap
  - id: F045
  - function: SwapReservationData
  - range:
      - 875
      - 900
  - args:
      - ReservationPtr Reservation1
      - ReservationPtr Reservation2
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void SwapReservationData(ReservationPtr Reservation1, ReservationPtr Reservation2)\n\
      {\n  int tmpID = Reservation1->ID;\n  int tmpUserID = Reservation1->UserID;\n\
      \  int tmpRoomID = Reservation1->RoomID;\n\n  stDate tmpDate = Reservation1->Date;\n\
      \  stTime tmpStart_Time = Reservation1->Start_Time;\n  stTime tmpEnd_Time =
      Reservation1->End_Time;\n\n  Reservation1->ID = Reservation2->ID;\n  Reservation1->UserID
      = Reservation2->UserID;\n  Reservation1->RoomID = Reservation2->RoomID;\n\n\
      \  Reservation1->Date = Reservation2->Date;\n  Reservation1->Start_Time = Reservation2->Start_Time;\n\
      \  Reservation1->End_Time = Reservation2->End_Time;\n\n  Reservation2->ID =
      tmpID;\n  Reservation2->UserID = tmpUserID;\n  Reservation2->RoomID = tmpRoomID;\n\
      \n  Reservation2->Date = tmpDate;\n  Reservation2->Start_Time = tmpStart_Time;\n\
      \  Reservation2->End_Time = tmpEnd_Time;\n}\n"
  - description: この関数は、2つの予約データ構造体の全てのフィールドを入れ替えることで、予約情報を交換します。
